description: Use English for all code comments, docs, and in-app text
alwaysApply: true
---

# Language: English

- **Code comments:** Write all comments in English (e.g. `// Update hotbar selection`, not German).
- **Documentation:** README, MULTIPLAYER.md, and any new docs should be in English.
- **User-facing text:** UI labels, hints, messages, and button text should be in English (e.g. "Pause", "Resume", "Multiplayer: 2 players").

When adding or editing code, keep variable/function names in English and use English for commit messages and doc updates.
